## Target Identity and Functional Architecture

The ideal preserves literal white pepper and basil-flower as a dry bright seam around ginger. The current build tests Black Pepper EO, Basil EO, Terpinyl Acetate, and ginger with stated substitutions. Culinary basil, harsh black pepper, and pine-fougere drift fail the name. TARGET / IDEAL remains separate in `../candidates/LH-07.json`.

## Current-Inventory Build — Heuristic Volume Adapter

The shared child core is 4,200 µL and the controlled module is exactly 300 µL. Basil EO is not covered by the current composite-natural decomposition, so strict OAV and release remain HOLD.

