## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

TARGET / IDEAL retains basil and white pepper. CURRENT omits Basil because the lot lacks defensible composite-natural authority; linalool and terpinyl acetate cover only aromatic lift. Unavailable Ethyl Linalool and unresolved Pamzest/Parmavert were also removed with explicit losses. Verify EB; procure nothing before a constant-total addition/omission test.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

After composite-data resolution, compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LH-07 and LH-01 at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours in balanced order. Score identity, pepper brightness versus harshness, basil floral versus culinary drift, and liking. No observation exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

